     So why[0m[2m does[0m[2m the[0m[2m current[0m[2m code produce[0m[2m negative inventory[0m[2m?
     
     Ah[0m[2m,[0m[2m because in[0m[2m the[0m[2m current `[0m[2mcheckout.py[0m[2m`:
     1[0m[2m. `[0m[2mawait inventory[0m[2m.check_stock[0m[2m(quantity[0m[2m)` -[0m[2m check[0m[2m returns[0m[2m True[0m[2m
